<title>AUSTRIA: Wiener St'sche 96 pretax down 5.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Wiener St'sche 96 pretax down 5.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian insurance company Wiener Staedtische AG said on Thursday it had posted a preliminary parent pre-tax profit of 1.03 billion schillings in 1996.</p>
<p>In 1995, pretax profit was 5.5 percent higher at 1.09 billion schillings.  </p>
<p>Wiener Staedtische said that insurance benefits, up 6.4 percent to 10.4 billion schillings, did not show as strong a rise as premium income, which jumped nine percent to 17.3 billion schillings.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 253</p>
</text>
